; THE EAST WALL HAS A SIXTEEN-METRE GAP IN IT AT z 0, where the pit head comes
; through — _citadel_rim builds the east curtain in two lengths either side of
; it exactly as it does the west curtain either side of the gate. So the walk
; is not a circuit: it is broken at the gatehouse AND here, into a northern L
; and a southern one. (626, 14, 0) reads 5.9 m off the mesh and snaps down to
; the pit head for precisely that reason, which is how the gap was found.
